{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And they made their father drink wine that night — he.</b> It should have said 'that night' (בלילה ההוא), but the word 'he' (הוא) is the name of the Holy One, blessed be He, and this is what the Rabbis of blessed memory expounded: the Holy One, blessed be He, assisted in that deed, and wine was made available to them in the cave."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:42.940468924Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}